{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Bouw een compleet Shopify AI-blok: fotoreviewcarrousel voor Susan’s Aspen Boutique. Lever vormgeving, werkende mobiele bediening en alle editorvelden samen op.
    
    INSTELLINGEN
    Gebruik block.settings met 8 reviewgroepen, zonder geneste blokken. Iedere groep heeft unieke IDs review_1_enabled/image/position/text/rating t/m review_8. Per review: aan/uit, foto, fotopositie Top/Center/Bottom, tekst, score 1–5 met step:0.5. Standaard score 5, positie Center. Elke kaart leest uitsluitend zijn eigen velden. Bij uitschakelen blijven oorspronkelijke reviewnummers behouden.
    Algemene velden: titel, label, algemene score 1–5 met step:0.1 (standaard 4.7), reviewaantaltekst, kleuren, lettergroottes mobiel/desktop, boven-/onderruimte.
    Kaartbreedte mobiel instelbaar 75–94%, standaard 88%; desktop 280–440 px, standaard 360 px. Behoud het volledige instellingen-schema bij updates.
    
    VORMGEVING
    Achtergrond #F2F2F2, witte kaarten, tekst #111, sterren #FFD21C. Themalettertype, normaal gewicht.
    Volgorde: gecentreerde titel; beoordelingsregel; optionele reviewaantaltekst; kaarten; navigatie.
    Titel: HERE’S WHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY. Desktop 30 px; mobiel 16 px op één regel waar mogelijk, anders evenwichtig verdeeld over twee regels. Nooit SAY alleen. Kopzijruimte 12 px.
    Beoordeling exact “Excellent 4.7/5” met vijf sterren ernaast, gecentreerde flexrij, gap 8 px. /5 vast achter instelbare score. Tekst niet afbreken. Tekst mobiel/desktop 16/22 px; sterren 23/30 px. Reviewaantaltekst 15/19 px, verbergen indien leeg.
    Sectiepadding 28 px boven/onder; kopregels 12 px uit elkaar; 20 px tot kaarten.
    
    AFMETINGEN
    Zichtbaar carrouselvenster width:100%, max-width:1240px, margin:auto, min-width:0. Alle tussenliggende flex/grid-wrappers min-width:0 en max-width:100%.
    Meet W als clientWidth van dit venster, nooit scrollWidth van de kaartenrij.
    Mobiel kaartbreedte = W maal ingestelde percentage. Vanaf 990 px ingestelde desktoppixels. Begrens tot W-24 px. Zet uitkomst in CSS-variabele in pixels.
    Kaarten: width en flex-basis gelijk aan die variabele; flex-grow:0; flex-shrink:0; min-width:0; box-sizing:border-box; position:relative.
    Witte achtergrond, rand 1 px #DEDEDE, radius 12 px, padding 12 px. Gap mobiel 12 px, desktop 20 px. Kaarthoogte volgt inhoud, zonder vaste hoogte. Geen horizontale pagina-overflow.
    
    FOTO
    Elke fotocontainer: width:100%; aspect-ratio:1/1; position:relative; overflow:hidden; padding:0; min-height:0; flex:none; border-radius:9px.
    Alleen de foto binnen dit vlak staat absoluut: inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover.
    Fotopositie bepaalt object-position:center top/center center/center bottom.
    Geen viewporthoogte, padding-bottom-truc of uitrekking door SVG.
    Ontbrekende foto in editor: vierkant grijs vlak met gecentreerd icoon 40×40 px.
    Voorbeeld W=375 px, kaart 88%: kaart 330 px, foto 304×304 px.
    Render alle ingestelde foto’s direct met echte src/srcset en loading="eager". Geen data-src, lazyloadklasse of afhankelijkheid van actieve slide. Reserveer het fotovlak vooraf. Geen witte foto’s tijdens swipen.
    
    STERREN EN REVIEWTEKST
    Onder iedere foto een sterrenrij met display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; width:100%; gap:4px; margin:12px 0 0; padding:0. Sterren 20×20 px, niet krimpen. Altijd als compacte groep onder het fotomidden.
    Per ster index 0–4: vulling = clamp(score-index,0,1) × 100%. Grijze basis en goud overlappen exact, nooit dubbele rijen. 4.5 geeft vier volle plus één halve ster; 4.7 vier volle plus 70%. Geen parseInt of afronden. SVG-IDs uniek per blok/review/ster. Algemene score onafhankelijk van individuele scores.
    Reviewtekst na 12 px, gecentreerd, mobiel/desktop 16/17 px, regelhoogte 1.45. Volledig zichtbaar; leeg tekstveld verbergen. Foto, sterren en tekst bewegen samen binnen hun eigen kaart.
    
    SCROLLEN EN NAVIGATIE
    Gebruik alleen native horizontaal scrollen: één overflow-x:auto venster met één flexrij. Geen translateX, gekloonde slides, absolute kaarten of eigen touch-dragcode. touch-action:pan-x pan-y; geen preventDefault op touchmove. Verticaal paginaswipen blijft werken.
    Gebruik scroll-snap-type:x mandatory en scroll-snap-align:center.
    Voeg begin-/eindpadding toe van (W-kaartbreedte)/2, zonder extra gap. Ook eerste en laatste kaart moeten kunnen centreren.
    Maak één geordende lijst van ingeschakelde kaarten voor alle bediening. Eén stip per kaart. Alle acht bereikbaar. Pijlen wijzigen doelindex met één, begrensd tot de echte eerste/laatste.
    Klikken gebruiken uitsluitend scrollTo op dit venster: actuele scrollLeft + verschil tussen kaartmidden en venstermidden. Geen opgetelde procentuele verschuivingen.
    Scroll-events bepalen alleen de actieve stip vanuit de dichtstbijzijnde kaart; roep daarin nooit scrollTo aan.
    Initialiseer eenmaal per blok; ruim listeners op bij herinitialisatie. Herbereken bij gewijzigde breedte of instellingen, niet bij alleen veranderde mobiele schermhoogte. Behoud actieve review.
    Navigatie 22 px onder kaarten: dunne zwarte pijlen zonder achtergrond, ronde stippen, act
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | remove: '_' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-family: {{ settings.type_base_font_family.family }}, {{ settings.type_base_font_family.fallback_families }};
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} *, .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before, .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner { width: 100%; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading {
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    max-width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_desktop_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 400;
    overflow-wrap: normal;
  }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; margin: 0 auto 12px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-text { font-size: {{ block.settings.summary_desktop_size }}px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-stars { display: inline-flex; gap: 2px; align-items: center; flex: none; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-star { width: {{ block.settings.summary_star_desktop_size }}px; height: {{ block.settings.summary_star_desktop_size }}px; flex: none; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count { margin: 0 auto 0; text-align: center; font-size: {{ block.settings.count_desktop_size }}px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport { width: 100%; max-width: 1240px; min-width: 0; margin: 20px auto 0; overflow-x: auto; overflow-y: hidden; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; touch-action: pan-x pan-y; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scrollbar-width: none; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 20px; width: max-content; min-width: 100%; max-width: none; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card { width: var(--ai-card-width, 360px); flex: 0 0 var(--ai-card-width, 360px); min-width: 0; position: relative; padding: 12px; background: {{ block.settings.card_color }}; border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }}; border-radius: 12px; scroll-snap-align: center; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 0; min-height: 0; flex: none; border-radius: 9px; background: #e6e6e6; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #666; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; width: 100%; gap: 4px; margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 0; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; display: block; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__review-text { margin: 12px 0 0; text-align: center; font-size: {{ block.settings.review_mobile_size }}px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 400; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__navigation { min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; margin: 22px auto 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { width: 32px; height: 32px; padding: 0; display: inline-flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; background: transparent; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:disabled { opacity: .35; cursor: default; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot { width: 9px; height: 9px; padding: 0; border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.text_color }}; border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; cursor: pointer; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot[aria-current="true"] { background: {{ block.settings.text_color }}; }
  .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:focus-visible, .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid {{ block.settings.text_color }}; outline-offset: 3px; }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__review-text { font-size: {{ block.settings.review_desktop_size }}px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_mobile_size }}px; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-text { font-size: {{ block.settings.summary_mobile_size }}px; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-star { width: {{ block.settings.summary_star_mobile_size }}px; height: {{ block.settings.summary_star_mobile_size }}px; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count { font-size: {{ block.settings.count_mobile_size }}px; }
    .ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track { gap: 12px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<ai-review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-mobile-width="{{ block.settings.mobile_card_width }}" data-desktop-width="{{ block.settings.desktop_card_width }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <h2 class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h2>
    <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary" aria-label="Excellent {{ block.settings.overall_rating }} out of 5">
      <span class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-text">Excellent {{ block.settings.overall_rating }}/5</span>
      <span class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-stars" aria-hidden="true">
        {% for star_index in (1..5) %}
          {% assign star_fill = block.settings.overall_rating | minus: forloop.index0 | times: 100 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 100 %}
          <svg class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__summary-star" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><defs><linearGradient id="ai-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ forloop.index }}"><stop offset="{{ star_fill }}%" stop-color="{{ block.settings.star_color }}"/><stop offset="{{ star_fill }}%" stop-color="#bdbdbd"/></linearGradient></defs><path fill="url(#ai-summary-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ forloop.index }})" d="M12 2.2l2.96 6 6.62.96-4.79 4.67 1.13 6.6L12 17.32l-5.92 3.11 1.13-6.6-4.79-4.67 6.62-.96z"/></svg>
        {% endfor %}
      </span>
    </div>
    {% if block.settings.review_count_text != blank %}<p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__count">{{ block.settings.review_count_text | escape }}</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport" data-viewport tabindex="0" aria-label="Customer photo reviews">
      <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>
        {% for review_index in (1..8) %}
          {% liquid
            assign enabled_key = 'review_' | append: review_index | append: '_enabled'
            assign image_key = 'review_' | append: review_index | append: '_image'
            assign position_key = 'review_' | append: review_index | append: '_position'
            assign text_key = 'review_' | append: review_index | append: '_text'
            assign rating_key = 'review_' | append: review_index | append: '_rating'
            assign review_enabled = block.settings[enabled_key]
            assign review_image = block.settings[image_key]
            assign review_position = block.settings[position_key]
            assign review_text = block.settings[text_key]
            assign review_rating = block.settings[rating_key]
            assign object_position = 'center center'
            if review_position == 'top'
              assign object_position = 'center top'
            elsif review_position == 'bottom'
              assign object_position = 'center bottom'
            endif
          %}
          {% if review_enabled %}
            <article class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card" data-review-card data-review-number="{{ review_index }}">
              <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo">
                {% if review_image != blank %}
                  <img src="{{ review_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" srcset="{{ review_image | image_url: width: 360 }} 360w, {{ review_image | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ review_image | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 360px, 88vw" width="{{ review_image.width }}" height="{{ review_image.height }}" alt="{{ review_image.alt | default: 'Customer review photo' | escape }}" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" style="object-position: {{ object_position }};">
                {% else %}
                  <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder" aria-label="Add a review photo">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__stars" aria-label="Rated {{ review_rating }} out of 5">
                {% for star_index in (1..5) %}
                  {% assign star_fill = review_rating | minus: forloop.index0 | times: 100 | at_least: 0 | at_most: 100 %}
                  <svg class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__star" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="ai-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ review_index }}-{{ forloop.index }}"><stop offset="{{ star_fill }}%" stop-color="{{ block.settings.star_color }}"/><stop offset="{{ star_fill }}%" stop-color="#bdbdbd"/></linearGradient></defs><path fill="url(#ai-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}-{{ review_index }}-{{ forloop.index }})" d="M12 2.2l2.96 6 6.62.96-4.79 4.67 1.13 6.6L12 17.32l-5.92 3.11 1.13-6.6-4.79-4.67 6.62-.96z"/></svg>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>
              {% if review_text != blank %}<p class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__review-text">{{ review_text | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>{% endif %}
            </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__navigation" data-navigation aria-label="Review carousel navigation">
      <button class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Previous review"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
      <div class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dots" data-dots></div>
      <button class="ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next review"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
    </nav>
  </div>
</ai-review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
(() => {
  const tag = 'ai-review-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}';
  if (customElements.get(tag)) return;
  class AIReviewCarousel extends HTMLElement {
    connectedCallback() {
      if (this.initialized) this.cleanup();
      this.initialized = true;
      this.viewport = this.querySelector('[data-viewport]');
      this.cards = Array.from(this.querySelectorAll('[data-review-card]'));
      this.nav = this.querySelector('[data-navigation]');
      this.dots = this.querySelector('[data-dots]');
      this.prev = this.querySelector('[data-prev]');
      this.next = this.querySelector('[data-next]');
      this.activeIndex = Math.min(this.activeIndex || 0, Math.max(0, this.cards.length - 1));
      this.dots.innerHTML = '';
      this.cards.forEach((card, index) => {
        const dot = document.createElement('button');
        dot.type = 'button';
        dot.className = 'ai-review-{{ ai_gen_id }}__dot';
        dot.setAttribute('aria-label', `Go to review ${card.dataset.reviewNumber}`);
        dot.addEventListener('click', () => this.goTo(index));
        this.dots.appendChild(dot);
      });
      this.onScroll = () => this.updateActive();
      this.onPrev = () => this.goTo(Math.max(0, this.activeIndex - 1));
      this.onNext = () => this.goTo(Math.min(this.cards.length - 1, this.activeIndex + 1));
      this.viewport.addEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll, { passive: true });
      this.prev.addEventListener('click', this.onPrev);
      this.next.addEventListener('click', this.onNext);
      this.resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver(() => this.layout());
      this.resizeObserver.observe(this.viewport);
      this.layout();
      requestAnimationFrame(() => this.goTo(this.activeIndex, false));
    }
    disconnectedCallback() { this.cleanup(); }
    cleanup() {
      if (this.viewport && this.onScroll) this.viewport.removeEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll);
      if (this.prev && this.onPrev) this.prev.removeEventListener('click', this.onPrev);
      if (this.next && this.onNext) this.next.removeEventListener('click', this.onNext);
      if (this.resizeObserver) this.resizeObserver.disconnect();
      this.initialized = false;
    }
    layout() {
      if (!this.viewport || !this.cards.length) {
        if (this.nav) this.nav.hidden = true;
        return;
      }
      this.nav.hidden = this.cards.length < 2;
      const width = this.viewport.clientWidth;
      const mobile = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 989px)').matches;
      const desired = mobile ? width * (Number(this.dataset.mobileWidth) / 100) : Number(this.dataset.desktopWidth);
      const cardWidth = Math.max(1, Math.min(desired, width - 24));
      this.style.setProperty('--ai-card-width', `${cardWidth}px`);
      const sideSpace = Math.max(0, (width - cardWidth) / 2);
      this.viewport.style.paddingInline = `${sideSpace}px`;
      this.updateActive();
    }
    goTo(index, smooth = true) {
      if (!this.cards || !this.cards.length) return;
      this.activeIndex = Math.max(0, Math.min(index, this.cards.length - 1));
      const card = this.cards[this.activeIndex];
      const delta = (card.offsetLeft + card.offsetWidth / 2) - (this.viewport.scrollLeft + this.viewport.clientWidth / 2);
      this.viewport.scrollTo({ left: this.viewport.scrollLeft + delta, behavior: smooth ? 'smooth' : 'auto' });
      this.renderNav();
    }
    updateActive() {
      if (!this.cards || !this.cards.length || !this.viewport) return;
      const center = this.viewport.getBoundingClientRect().left + this.viewport.clientWidth / 2;
      let closest = 0;
      let distance = Infinity;
      this.cards.forEach((card, index) => {
        const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();
        const current = Math.abs(rect.left + rect.width / 2 - center);
        if (current < distance) { distance = current; closest = index; }
      });
      this.activeIndex = closest;
      this.renderNav();
    }
    renderNav() {
      if (!this.dots) return;
      Array.from(this.dots.children).forEach((dot, index) => dot.setAttribute('aria-current', index === this.activeIndex ? 'true' : 'false'));
      this.prev.disabled = this.activeIndex <= 0;
      this.next.disabled = this.activeIndex >= this.cards.length - 1;
    }
  }
  customElements.define(tag, AIReviewCarousel);
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Photo review carousel",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Content" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Heading", "default": "HERE’S WHAT OUR CUSTOMERS SAY" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "overall_rating", "label": "Overall rating", "min": 1, "max": 5, "step": 0.1, "default": 4.7 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "review_count_text", "label": "Review count text", "default": "Based on customer reviews" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Layout" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "mobile_card_width", "label": "Mobile card width", "min": 75, "max": 94, "step": 1, "unit": "%", "default": 88 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_card_width", "label": "Desktop card width", "min": 280, "max": 440, "step": 10, "unit": "px", "default": 360 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_top", "label": "Top spacing", "min": 0, "max": 60, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 28 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding_bottom", "label": "Bottom spacing", "min": 0, "max": 60, "step": 2, "unit": "px", "default": 28 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Typography" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "heading_desktop_size", "label": "Heading desktop", "min": 20, "max": 40, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 30 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "heading_mobile_size", "label": "Heading mobile", "min": 12, "max": 20, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 16 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "summary_desktop_size", "label": "Rating text desktop", "min": 14, "max": 28, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 22 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "summary_mobile_size", "label": "Rating text mobile", "min": 12, "max": 20, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 16 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "summary_star_desktop_size", "label": "Summary stars desktop", "min": 20, "max": 36, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 30 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "summary_star_mobile_size", "label": "Summary stars mobile", "min": 18, "max": 28, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 23 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "count_desktop_size", "label": "Count text desktop", "min": 14, "max": 24, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 19 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "count_mobile_size", "label": "Count text mobile", "min": 12, "max": 18, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 15 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "review_desktop_size", "label": "Review text desktop", "min": 14, "max": 22, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 17 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "review_mobile_size", "label": "Review text mobile", "min": 14, "max": 20, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 16 },
